- **Model side, using `preprocess_model_input`:** pass a function to `Evaluation(preprocess_model_input=...)`. It runs on each dataset row before the row reaches your model. It receives the original row and returns a dictionary with the fields your model expects, so you can turn `input_text` into `question` [S1].
